api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":343,"closed_issues":2335,"state":"open","created_at":"2026-04-13T15:59:35Z","updated_at":"2026-10-22T06:28:22Z","due_on":null,"closed_at":null},"comments":4,"created_at":"2026-07-17T09:00:08Z","updated_at":"2026-08-30T18:21:31Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\nreproducible in:\n- 4.7-stable\n- 4.7.1-stable\n\nnot reproducible in:\n- 4.6.3-stable\n\n### System information\n\nWindows 11 (build 26200) - Multi-window, 1 monitor - OpenGL 3 (Compatibility) - NVIDIA GeForce RTX 4070 Laptop GPU (NVIDIA; 32.0.15.5597) - 13th Gen Intel(R) Core(TM) i9-13900H (20 threads) - 15.62 GiB memory - WASAPI (48000 Hz, Stereo/mono)\n\n### Issue description\n\nwhen `display/window/stretch/mode` is set to `canvas_items`..\n`Button` control nodes can be pressed outside of the viewport by pressing on where they would be on the black borders on android\nthis does not happen on windows where the controls simply ignore cursor clicks that are outside of the viewport\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n1. set `display/window/stretch/mode` to `canvas_items` (this will allow the black borders to show up)\n2. create a scene with a `Button` control node and place it outside of the viewport\n3. connect the button's `pressed` signal to a print function\n4. run the project on an android device\n5. press on where the button would be behind the black borders\n6. observe the print function activate\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[black_border_input_mrp.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/30117633/black_border_input_mrp.zip)","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/121492/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/121492/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null}